Maintainer: Anne Philippe <anne.philippe@univ-nantes.fr>
Description: A refined fork of the original BayLum R package. This update
    introduces several new capabilities, particularly for Age processing,
    where we aim to test different prior assumptions without incurring
    the computational cost associated with the Palaeodose Model.
